{"heading":"10.7 Irreversible branch outcomes","source":{"artifact":"HANEZAWA_CORE_GENESIS_V1_1.md","heading":"10.7 Irreversible branch outcomes","line_end":5731,"line_start":5716,"sha256":"edf16b1204a0b8c656b0418e39b41c3306a995dc70a324c939b507483f783053"},"source_text":"Genesis permits irreversible consequences when branch events justify them:

