{"heading":"16.4 Event and memory requirements","source":{"artifact":"HANEZAWA_CORE_GENESIS_V1_1.md","heading":"16.4 Event and memory requirements","line_end":6502,"line_start":6474,"sha256":"edf16b1204a0b8c656b0418e39b41c3306a995dc70a324c939b507483f783053"},"source_text":"Each event record must preserve:

