{"heading":"16.7 Human-quality tests","source":{"artifact":"HANEZAWA_CORE_GENESIS_V1_1.md","heading":"16.7 Human-quality tests","line_end":6568,"line_start":6549,"sha256":"edf16b1204a0b8c656b0418e39b41c3306a995dc70a324c939b507483f783053"},"source_text":"Blind voice review should ask whether a reader can identify the speaker from:

