{"heading":"16.8 Final quality standard","source":{"artifact":"HANEZAWA_CORE_GENESIS_V1_1.md","heading":"16.8 Final quality standard","line_end":6595,"line_start":6569,"sha256":"edf16b1204a0b8c656b0418e39b41c3306a995dc70a324c939b507483f783053"},"source_text":"A valid CERA decision should make it possible to understand:

